    <description>Runs on Create or Update of Account Account Relationship, finds relationships related to the AccountID from the Account Account Relationship that triggered the flow. Flow counts total number of relationships then updates the &quot;Number of Relationships&quot; field on the Account from the Account Account Relationship that triggered the flow. [Arkus/BL 4-3-26]
v6 - Added Logic to update &quot;Number of Relationships&quot; on Related Account as well. [Arkus/BL 4-3-26]</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Adds the number of AARs and ACRs</description>
        <name>for_NumberOfRelationships</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!var_Num_CountAARs} + {!var_Num_CountACRs}</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>for_NumberOfRelationships_RelatedAccount</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!var_Num_CountAARs_RelatedAccount}+{!var_Num_CountACRs_RelatedAccount}</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Account Account Relationship: Update Number of Relationships on Account {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Account Account Relationship: Update Number of Relationships on Account</label>
